<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>{{subject}}</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Google Sans', Roboto, Segoe UI, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            color: #3c4043;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }
        .card {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid #dadce0;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 40px;
            box-shadow: 0 1px 2px 0 rgba(60,64,67,.30), 0 1px 3px 1px rgba(60,64,67,.15);
        }
        .logo {
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            width: 125px;
            height: auto;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #202124;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 400;
            line-height: 32px;
            margin: 0 0 16px;
        }
        p {
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 21px;
            margin: 0 0 20px;
        }
        .button-container {
            margin: 32px 0;
        }
        .button {
            background-color: #1a73e8;
            color: #ffffff !important;
            padding: 10px 24px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-weight: 500;
            font-size: 14px;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 32px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #70757a;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .divider {
            height: 1px;
            background-color: #dadce0;
            margin: 24px 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="card">
            <img src="https://timemoz.com/logo.png" alt="Timemoz Logo" class="logo">
            
            <p>Your 14-day trial of the Timemoz Grow suite is coming to a close. We hope these advanced tools—the same ones we use to manage our internal team of hundreds of people across 3 continents—have helped you gain better visibility into your team's workflow.</p>
            <br/>
            <p>Once the trial ends, you can choose the plan that best fits your team’s size and needs:</p>
            <ol>
                <li>Grow ($4.99/seat): Maintain full access to everything you’ve used in the trial, including Unlimited Projects, Unlimited Screenshots, and our advanced Cheat Detection.</li>
                <li>Starter ($2.99/seat): Perfect for small teams needing the essentials, including time tracking, activity levels, and up to 3 projects.</li>
            </ol>
            <br />
            <p>What would you like to do next?</p>
            <ol>
                <li>Upgrade Now: Choose your plan and add payment details in your billing dashboard.</li>
                <li>Need More Time? Reply to this email, and we’ll personally extend your trial by one week so you can keep testing our unlimited features.</li>
            </ol>
            <br />
            <p>You can opt out or change your plan at any time through your Timemoz billing dashboard.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p style="margin: 0; padding: 0; font-size: 12px;">Jl. Mampang Prapatan Raya no 17c, Mampang Prapatan, Jakarta Selatan, Indonesia, 12790</p>
            <p style="margin: 0; padding: 0; font-size: 12px;">© 2026 Timemoz, Jakarta, Indonesia</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>